- Verify: strips multiple sequences within one line
   - Expected: strip_ansi("\x1b[32mPASS\x1b[0m test/sample_spec.spl \x1b[2m(2 passed)\x1b[0m") equals `PASS test/sample_spec.spl (2 passed)`


